2. Verify an Instrument
User Flow:
User lands on "Verify" page.
User pastes a CID or digest (or selects from localStorage).
System:
Retrieves the instrument from IPFS (if CID) or localStorage (if digest).
Performs the 7-step verification:
Retrieves payload from IPFS (if CID provided).
Hashes payload locally and compares to CID.
Verifies Ed25519 signature over the composite key.
Checks `previous` field matches the prior instrument’s composite key.
Recomputes composite key and confirms it matches the instrument’s `composite` field.
Iterates backward to `"GENESIS"` (Instrument #000).
Confirms the chain is unbroken.
Displays verification result (✅ Valid or ❌ Invalid with errors).
